; The YM2608 has six drums in its ROM: kick snare ride hat tom4 rim, a track
; each. The ROM is Yamaha's and does not ship: File > Import > YM2608 Rhythm
; ROM… plays your own. Without it a kit's samples stand in, cut to the ROM's
; lengths: rx5 here, the kit the song imports (VGM, mucom88 …) use; import
; another preset kit (tr808, tr909, gm-drums …) or a SoundFont's drums
; (File > Import > Instruments…), and the same tracks play those.
; Try: switch the kit to another preset.
(def-score :target pc88)
(import "presets/rx5/set.mmlisp")
(rhythm1 kick :len 4 c c c c)
(rhythm2 hat (x 8 c))
(rhythm3 snare :len 2 _ c)
